      "id": "claim_7fa9c370abc6421aa470ee352c870fbe",
      "statement": "The `doc2.py` and `doc3.py` prototype login flows use submitted email and password as PostgreSQL connection credentials, then select all rows from `account` and derive the demat number from the first row's first field; this is database-role authentication rather than an application-layer password check.",
